{"seq":3,"slug":"higher-education-studies","title":"高等教育学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies","introMarkdown":"# 高等教育学 简介\n\n高等教育学以大学和高等教育系统为研究对象，探讨大学治理、教学创新、教育公平和全球化趋势等核心议题。在高等教育大众化和国际化加速推进的背景下，这一领域的研究对于理解和改善大学教育具有重要的理论价值和实践意义。\n\n本课程从高等教育的理论基础和治理结构出发，经由大学教学与学习过程的分析和教育公平的深入讨论，最终延伸至全球高等教育的最新发展趋势，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**高等教育理论与治理**探讨大学组织的核心理论问题。大学治理模式的多样性及其制度逻辑、学术自由作为大学基本价值的理论基础和现实挑战、以及大学排名对高等教育生态的深刻影响，构成了理解当代大学的基本分析框架。\n\n第二章**大学教学与学习**聚焦高等教育的核心功能。学生参与度的概念框架和提升策略、教学创新在技术与理念层面的新发展以及高等教育中评估方式的变革，反映了大学从以教为中心向以学为中心转变的持续努力。\n\n第三章**高等教育公平与入学**关注高等教育机会的分配正义。入学政策的制度设计与效果评估、校园多元与包容的理念和实践以及国际学生流动带来的机遇和挑战，展示了高等教育在促进社会公平方面的角色和责任。\n\n第四章**全球高等教育趋势**追踪重塑大学面貌的宏观变革力量。高等教育大众化的全球进程、国际化战略的多维实践以及数字化转型对大学教学和管理的深远影响，描绘了高等教育系统正在经历的结构性变迁。\n\n建议学习者在阅读各章时结合自己所在大学的实际情况进行对照思考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theory-governance","title":"高等教育理论与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/theory-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"university-governance","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 大学治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/theory-governance/university-governance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"academic-freedom","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 学术自由","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/theory-governance/academic-freedom"},{"seq":3,"slug":"university-rankings","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 大学排名","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/theory-governance/university-rankings"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"teaching-learning","title":"大学教学与学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/teaching-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"student-engagement","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 学生参与","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/teaching-learning/student-engagement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pedagogical-innovation","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 教学创新","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/teaching-learning/pedagogical-innovation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"assessment-in-he","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 高教评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/teaching-learning/assessment-in-he"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"access-equity","title":"高等教育公平与入学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/access-equity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"access-policies","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 入学政策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/access-equity/access-policies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diversity-inclusion","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 多元与包容","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/access-equity/diversity-inclusion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-students","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 国际学生","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/access-equity/international-students"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"global-trends","title":"全球高等教育趋势","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/global-trends","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"massification","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 大众化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/global-trends/massification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"internationalization","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 国际化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/global-trends/internationalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-transformation-he","title":"研究生 高等教育学 — 数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/education/higher-education-studies/global-trends/digital-transformation-he"}]}]}